color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">电瓶船</span>：有 4 座和 6 座，价格分别为 180 元 / 小时和 220 元 / 小时；还有造型电瓶船 4 座，价格为 200 元 / 小时。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">脚踏船</span>：有 4 座和 6 座，价格分别为 120 元 / 小时和 180 元 / 小时。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">手划船</span>：非助力 100 元 / 小时，助力 180 元 / 小时。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">荷花船</span>：分 4/6/8 人座，价格分别为 200 元 / 小时、240 元 / 小时、320 元 / 小时。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">摇橹船</span>：40 元 / 人 / 半小时，有专人摇橹。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">环湖龙舟</span>：50 元 / 人，是环线，在五方亭上下船。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">大摆渡船</span>：20 元 / 人，从北岸五方亭至琼华岛漪澜堂。</li>\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 8px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 28px; list-style-type: disc; overflow-anchor: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; color: #000000 !important;\">小摆渡船</span>：5 元 / 人，从西岸码头至琼华岛琳光殿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"header-vfC6AV auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; font-size: 18px; line-height: 28px; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0px 0px 0px !important 0px; margin: 28px 0px 12px !important 0px;\">码头分布</h3>\n<ul class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline: none; border: 0px solid; padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px; list-style: none; overflow-anchor: auto; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro SC', 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Icons', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin: 8px !important 0px 8px !important 0px;\">\n<li style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialias